{
  "name": "orboto: sync ticket with external system",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## orboto <-> external ticket sync\n\n**Outbound (top):** the orboto Trigger fires on `ticket.created` / `ticket.updated` and upserts the ticket into the external system. Replace the URL and body mapping with your system's API.\n\n**Inbound (bottom):** the external system POSTs changes to the webhook. The IF node drops callbacks that originated from this sync (`source = orboto-n8n-sync`) so the two directions cannot loop. The orboto node then updates only the fields listed under **Update Fields** - everything else on the ticket stays untouched.\n\nSet `YOUR_PROJECT_ID`, point both HTTP nodes at your system, and connect an orboto credential (API key or OAuth2).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "How this works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "project": "YOUR_PROJECT_ID",
        "events": ["ticket.created", "ticket.updated"],
        "additionalEvents": ""
      },
      "id": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "orboto Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-orboto.orbotoTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -120],
      "webhookId": "00000000-4000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "credentials": {
        "orbotoApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "orboto API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://external.example.com/api/issues/upsert",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "X-Source", "value": "orboto-n8n-sync" }]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ externalKey: $json.ticketKey || $json.id, title: $json.title, status: $json.statusName || $json.status, priority: $json.priority, updatedAt: $json.updatedAt, source: 'orboto-n8n-sync' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Upsert external issue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [240, -120],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "orboto-external-sync",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "External change webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 140],
      "webhookId": "00000000-4000-4000-8000-000000000002"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.source }}",
              "rightValue": "orboto-n8n-sync",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Not our own echo?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [240, 140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "ticket",
        "operation": "update",
        "project": "YOUR_PROJECT_ID",
        "ticket": "={{ $json.ticketKey }}",
        "updateFields": {
          "description": "={{ $json.description }}",
          "priority": "={{ $json.priority }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Update orboto ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-orboto.orboto",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 140],
      "credentials": {
        "orbotoApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "orboto API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "orboto Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Upsert external issue", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "External change webhook": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Not our own echo?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Not our own echo?": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Update orboto ticket", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {}
}
